      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "**Fast paper = live public market data + simulated taker execution.** A taker fill is created only after the engine walks the live ask book and the trade still clears the configured net-edge threshold after protocol fees, slippage and model-uncertainty penalty. This dashboard keeps taker, maker and multi-leg PnL/activity separate because they are distinct paper sleeves. No authenticated real-money order submission is enabled here."}
